kind comment in that zone you pointed, by \"fresh\" i meant before the reactions it was fresh so i expected that price would respect that zone. but maybe i wrote that in a wrong place that made this misunderstanding i really appreciate for your time hope to hear from you again","a":"pmbGUNNER","d":"","n":"#1382","p":56,"im":[],"m":1382},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1383","t":"HI eveybody another RBD/DBRs homework this time on GBPUSD h4 comments are so appreciated","a":"pmbGUNNER","d":"","n":"#1383","p":56,"im":["f60e9059fb12dc500c752dfc13a418ce23c34a86"],"m":1383},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1384","t":"HI GUNNER nice done mate if you don't mind i add some more to your chart try to find the DPs if price is too cheap or too expensive imagine you are a big boy with billions, think about that how could you hit others stop and make a lot of LQ for your unfilled orders. i marked two of them for you hope it helps keep up the good work mate.\n\nSalivan","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1384","p":56,"im":["b50304981ea22b36a413784f3c8ff349c4f449f9"],"m":1384},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1385","t":"HELLO guys another attempt on RBD/DBRs I'm eager to see your comments about it","a":"pmbGUNNER","d":"","n":"#1385","p":56,"im":["7ed5d92c12db4e047861478becf5612f1d432d6d"],"m":1385},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1386","t":"Thats some serious work here mate, really love it Keep up the good work","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1386","p":56,"im":[],"m":1386},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1387","t":"HELLO every one here is another HW of mine on RBD/DBRs any comments are welcomed.......","a":"pmbGUNNER","d":"","n":"#1387","p":56,"im":["5beed24bec1779144145fde2a24be1bb08b2159f"],"m":1387},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1388","t":"this is an other HW on RBD/DBR GBP/USD PREDICTION\n\nAND THE RESULT MY TARGET HIT\n\nCHEERS RTM SALIVAN","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1388","p":56,"im":["d2eb4eb9b9920e1b5ccd358fd6abad0a2de6beb4","7e36809cf89565ec003bc2063a7ca88c46713279"],"m":1388},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1389","t":"HI every body another attempt on RBD/DBRs this time on EUR/AUD h4 i put some other concepts in my chart as well hope it makes scense any comments are appreciated","a":"pmbGUNNER","d":"","n":"#1389","p":56,"im":["92b666773a0d4727fdad325cdd0c5fed54f9c0fe"],"m":1389},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1390","t":"Market already move","a":"BangsaMelayu","d":"","n":"#1390","p":56,"im":[],"m":1390},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1391","t":"Hi Doubletop, Trying to get my head around this but am puzzled. In your EURUSD example, I can't see where the origin of the moves originate from. Can you point them out? My question area is denoted by the black arrows. Thanks.","a":"nu2this","d":"","n":"#1391","p":56,"im":["d31c9c3c6b5017db0de98a4a69d0f97efd30e2c6"],"m":1391},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1392","t":"Picture is speaking loudly","a":"Ahmadhassan745","d":"","n":"#1392","p":56,"im":["c80905646e57f933f0575b8835abd91ea87367db"],"m":1392},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1393","t":"Good site. Trying to get all this to fit in my head.\n\nMy first homework. Comments appreciated.","a":"Granger","d":"","n":"#1393","p":56,"im":["2d0e5af2eb75fd6932036e31fce99f1949fbe005","4b5dfb357390361ea32a523285920b72e32e34c1","76e4bbcdd39d198a77a9f2fbabd2ec0ffdaeb3b9"],"m":1393},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1394","t":"hi every body here are my charts starting with this homework, please free to comment.","a":"K H A N","d":"","n":"#1394","p":56,"im":["48344b5ae9a469f7fbe86eade7720640518065e7"],"m":1394},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1395","t":"hi every body please free to comment.","a":"K H A N","d":"","n":"#1395","p":56,"im":["2dae174e2b28af176bd8d86c2c7e5c1c5d7210d4","25d597d66d2d05b715ce0920f0ace83d110088a5","b3cca9b8068051afcccc4dc6d67da6b9e6a46d72","c480552e2db4e536363def415a445ad2e7ba6bc4","c28c6f8f2a2a915b448950e795a7f943c6f1843e"],"m":1395},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1396","t":"hi KHAN nice work here from you keep up the good work glad to see new traders here","a":"pmbGUNNER","d":"","n":"#1396","p":56,"im":[],"m":1396},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1397","t":"hi every body more homework,please free to comment. thanks","a":"K H A N","d":"","n":"#1397","p":56,"im":["2de49aa8ac985e839cc9ae7d56f01ba6bfccc8cc","ca9048b8f343f478025bb9dab74941154f3923e1"],"m":1397},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1398","t":"Away\n\nHello!. I will start with one RBD yes I need 199 more but one must start with something","a":"corsica","d":"","n":"#1398","p":56,"im":["e147c192f187926971a404fbc806fe013bec8231"],"m":1398},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1399","t":"Hello corsica, I added some more RBD on your chart but there are more to add, some are pretty obvious, others are more evident on LTFs. I haven't added reactions to them. But there are lots of DBR and RBR and DBD to add too. Hope this helps. Keep up the good (home)work:)\n\nOOPS I haven't saved modified image... needs to restart the HW...\n\nDone:","a":"Al3cs","d":"","n":"#1399","p":56,"im":[],"m":1399},{"id":"dbrrbd_p56_1400","t":"Away\n\nHello Ai3cs Many thanks for taking the time to comment and complete my chart. You obviously right there are billions of DBR-RBD. I kept the chart basic because my idea was to toy a bit with the concept of \" how can I make these dbr/rbds work for me?\". In this example it is because the FL and the decision are clean and strong at this very specific level: the upper limit of a HTF RBD.This can give you confidence that the trade (return on DP) has a great probability. The RBD gives you this edge...\n\nYour chart allowed me to push this a bit further. When I saw your RBDs on the upper left I thought... Looks like stacked supply... and stacked supply = PAZ. Can I tie this in the RBD/DBR? So I have drawn two more to your chart. I don't know if my reasoning is correct or if I'm just \"curve fitting\" to see what I want to see. The fact is that there was an even better trade just under our noses! And now this FL makes even more sense..\n\nI have asked a question on the chart. If anyone can confirm or tell me that I need a drink and one or two days off?\n\n515253545556575859","a":"corsica","d":"","n":"#1400","p":56,"im":["0475ad584184b09b2614bd8b3c7dd339b1984200"],"m":1400}],"image